OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally, a fine and dry start
OL,6,Fto the day with patchy cloud over the
OL,7,FDales. Cloud fills in through the day
OL,8,Fwith an isolated shower bubbling up in
OL,9,Fthe west but feeling pleasant in any
OL,10,Fsunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud continues to thicken
OL,13,Fthrough the evening with isolated
OL,14,Fheavier showers developing in the
OL,15,Fnorth and west. Patchy rain develops
OL,16,Fmore widely by the end of the night.
OL,17,FTurning muggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
