OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FBecoming wet through the
OL,6,Fmorning with pulses of heavy rain
OL,7,Fduring the early afternoon. Rain
OL,8,Feasing but remaining a widely grey and
OL,9,Fdamp evening. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FRemaining unsettled, a brighter day
OL,14,Fwith isolated showers on Thursday.
OL,15,FFurther bands of rain at times on
OL,16,FFriday and Saturday with some drier
OL,17,Finterludes. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
